Private Sub CaseIllustrativeFxOneSidedPositions()
'
'==============================================================================
'                      CaseIllustrativeFxOneSidedPositions
'------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' PURPOSE
'   Test case illustrative-fx-one-sided-positions, on CALC-06: Net positions
'   that are all long, a currency whose rows net to zero, a position in gold
'   alone on its side, a position of zero and a row in the reporting
'   currency, which is excluded.
'
' STATE OWNERSHIP
'   Replaces the inputs of the workbook and rewrites the output
'   sheets; puts the inputs back and clears the output sheets.
'
' UPDATED
'   2026-11-16
